0","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #2: Leaving Breadcrumbs","summary":"Leaving breadcrumbsThe game is full of bugs, but they shouldn't be the ones you can't fight. This update adds a breadcrumbs system: in the parts of the game where most issues were reported, the game now remembers the last things that happened before an error. When you send a bug report from the in-game reporter, those breadcrumbs go with it, which gives me a much better chance of finding and fixing what went wrong. Thank you to everyone who has sent bug reports so far. They're the reason most of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:11:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035134","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:41:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2868030-1846651706681574","game_id":"steam-2868030","kind":"announcement","title":"Broken Intro Hot Fix","summary":"Version 0.9.26Hey everybody, thank you for all the feedback and bug reports, your effort is really appreciated!Hot Fix:I am really sorry for the game being unplayable for the past 3 hours, I was so tired after making the new build that I took a bit of a break, completely missing all the reports... So the thing is fixed now and you are more than welcome to give the game a shot now! Thank you so much for your patience! Patch notes NEW STUFF:Added some stats through steam integration to hopefully b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:56:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681574","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2868030-1846651706673516","game_id":"steam-2868030","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #1","summary":"Version 0.9.25Hey everybody, based on your feedback, I made a couple of small changes to the demo build and also fixed some of the reported issues! Important:I had some issue understanding the nature of a few reported bugs, so if you see this - please use the F5 button to directly open the bug reporter menu when you can and especially when a bug is of visual nature because this will give me a better screenshot to work with and it will also make it easier to see exactly where the bug happened in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:01:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2868030-1846018067929784","game_id":"steam-2868030","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out NOW!","summary":"The time has come! The game has finally reached the point where I’m happy (and slightly terrified) to share a demo with all of you! Go try it! There’s not much more to say other than: I’m really excited to hear what you think of it. And since this is a game called Game is Full of Bugs, there is a pretty good chance that you might actually encounter some bugs. If something goes wrong, I’d really appreciate it if you could use the in-game Bug Reporter to let me know what happened. That gives me a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:57:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929784","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2868030-1840310314347771","game_id":"steam-2868030","kind":"announcement","title":"Wishlists go up!","summary":"Wishlists just hit 6K!Two weeks ago wishlists started to grow, A LOT. I was just preparing to finally make this short little update and let everyone know we reached 5000 wishlists but in the last couple of days this number was raised to 6000 which is absolutely incredible! Thank you everyone!DevelopmentGame is moving along really well and I can't say much right now but I will make some announcements fairly soon :) If you are interested though, you can follow the development REAL closely as I str","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T15:56:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347771","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2868030-1817483467041111","game_id":"steam-2868030","kind":"announcement","title":"Want to try the game?","summary":"New Stuff!I've been hard at work for the past couple of months and the game is now at a point where I can start finishing parts of it and polishing what is already done which feels amazing! Some stuff that is coming:Tech tree for unlocking content!New equip-able type: Booster with which you will be able to upgrade any equipped bullet.Updated and polished tutorial.And moreA screenshot from the coming update:Tech tree:PlaytestBecause I am trying to mold the game into it's final form, I need to mak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-29T08:51:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467041111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2868030-1811138915539656","game_id":"steam-2868030","kind":"announcement","title":"POLARIS Con and SXSW Sydney","summary":"Game is Full of Bugs will be visiting some places! I will be personally attending the POLARIS Con in Hamburg from 10th to 12th of October. If you are from around there or are planning to visit, come say hi and try the game to see if it's your cup of tea! I would love to meet any of you. The game will also be showcased in SXSW Sydney from 13th to 19th of October, but I wont be there myself because it's just a little bit too expensive for me to get there right now, so the game will be showcased by","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-23T01:58:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811138915539656","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2868030-1806698490703513","game_id":"steam-2868030","kind":"update","title":"I Am Not Dead – First Update!","summary":"I Am Not Dead – And Neither Is the GameOkay, technically, this is the first update on Steam... Which means I never told you we were alive in the first place. Let’s fix that.New DevlogI just dropped a new devlog over on YouTube:Why I disappeared for 5 monthsWhat’s been brewing in developmentWhat’s next.Funding!Among us gave me money!As you might have seen on the store page, the game is now funded by Outersloth which was also one of the reasons I stopped posting for a bit - I finally felt like I c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-01T04:55:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490703513","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2868030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2868030":"2026-10-26T10:14:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2868030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:00Z"},"5318410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10